     "id": "nbc4-1",
     "speaker": "旁白",
     "speakerEn": "Narrator",
     "text": "月亮照着新下的雪，把屋顶照得像白天一样亮。",
     "textEn": "The moon on the top of the new-fallen snow\nMade it bright as the day on the houses below,",
     "audio": null
