    {
     "id": "nbc4-2",
     "speaker": "旁白",
     "speakerEn": "Narrator",
     "text": "我睁大眼睛——你猜我看见了什么？一辆小雪橇，八只小驯鹿，",
     "textEn": "When what to my wondering eyes should appear,\nBut a little sleigh, and eight tiny reindeer,",
     "audio": null
    },
    {
     "id": "nbc4-3",
     "speaker": "旁白",
     "speakerEn": "Narrator",
     "text": "还有一个小老头，又灵活又快，我一下子就知道：是圣诞老人来啦！",
     "textEn": "With a little old driver, so lively and quick,\nI knew in a moment it must be St. Nick.",
     "audio": null
