    {
     "id": "nbc5-2",
     "speaker": "圣诞老人",
     "speakerEn": "St. Nicholas",
     "text": "“冲冲！舞舞！蹦蹦，还有小狐！彗星！丘比！雷雷，还有闪闪！",
     "textEn": "“Now, Dasher! now, Dancer! now, Prancer and Vixen!\nOn, Comet! on, Cupid! on, Donder and Blitzen!",
