     "text": "他的眼睛亮晶晶！小酒窝笑眯眯！脸蛋像玫瑰，鼻子像樱桃！",
     "textEn": "His eyes—how they twinkled! his dimples, how merry!\nHis cheeks were like roses, his nose like a cherry!",
