     "id": "nbc8-2",
     "speaker": "旁白",
     "speakerEn": "Narrator",
     "text": "小嘴弯弯，像一张小弓，胡子白白，像雪一样；",
     "textEn": "His funny little mouth was drawn up like a bow,\nAnd the beard on his chin was as white as the snow.",
     "audio": null
