     "id": "nbc8-4",
     "speaker": "旁白",
     "speakerEn": "Narrator",
     "text": "他胖乎乎、圆滚滚，是个快乐的老精灵——我看着他，忍不住“噗”地笑出了声。",
     "textEn": "He was chubby and plump, a right jolly old elf,\nAnd I laughed when I saw him, in spite of myself.",
